  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2018-2026 Jeep Wrangler JL 4 Door Side Steps\nFeatures\n【Perfect Fitment】These side steps are compatible with the 2018-2026 Jeep Wrangler JL 4 Door (Only for 4 door & not for Wrangler JK)\n【Convenient Use】Features two-stair layout pedal design; The drop steps improve safety for people of all ages to get in and out; The wide pedal in the center has a higher platform, providing convenience when sweeping snow or placing luggage and items\n【Premium Material】The side step bars are made from thick, heavy duty steel pipes with a weight capacity of 550 lbs; The durable powder coating grants your vehicle side protection against dirt, water, and rust\n【Easy to Install】The Nerf bars can be easily installed at home using common garage tools; No drilling or cutting is required with pre-welded brackets\n【Distinctive Design】 The side step features a hollow design for drainage, which efficiently mitigates the build-up of water, snow, and debris on the steps\nProfessional installation recommended",
